            <description sparkle:format="html">&lt;!doctype html&gt;&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"&gt;&lt;style&gt;body{font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;margin:18px}h2{font-size:18px}ul{padding-left:22px}li{margin-bottom:12px}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Ingest 0.9.9.10&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fixed the Workspace menu in Import Photos. You can select any saved workspace, and a single checkmark shows which one is active.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Requires macOS 15 or later and an Apple silicon Mac.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
